MODULE: NoSpuriousRefusalSagaSkipsExpiryReRead
TARGET: NoSpuriousRefusal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a saga refuses after expiry even though the sampled scope recovered
PERTURBS: SagaRefuse

--- FIND
    /\ saga' = [saga EXCEPT !.status =
        IF saga.status = "waiting" /\ SagaValue = 2 THEN "refused" ELSE "ready"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: keep the pre-wait Saturated observation after expiry.
    /\ saga' = [saga EXCEPT !.status =
        IF saga.status = "waiting" THEN "refused" ELSE "ready"]
--- END
